---
source: crates/runtime/tests/models/search.rs
description: "SELECT subject FROM vector_search(qs, 'second', answer) order by _score desc LIMIT 4"
---
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                   |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Projection: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).subject                                                                                                                          |
|               |   Sort: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer)._score DESC NULLS FIRST, fetch=4                                                                                                     |
|               |     Projection: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).subject, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer)._score                                                                    |
|               |       TableScan: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer) projection=[_score, subject]                                                                                                |
| physical_plan | ProjectionExec: expr=[subject@3 as subject]                                                                                                                                            |
|               |   SortExec: TopK(fetch=4), expr=[_score@2 DESC NULLS LAST, id@0 ASC, question@1 ASC], preserve_partitioning=[false]                                                                    |
|               |     HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Left, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(id@0, id@0), (question@1, question@1)], projection=[id@0, question@1, _score@2, subject@5] |
|               |       CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |         ProjectionExec: expr=[union_extract(json_get(key@0, id), int) as id, union_extract(json_get(key@0, question), str) as question, 1 - distance@1 as _score]                      |
|               |           CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |             BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |               RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                     |
|               |                 CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                   S3VectorsQueryExec (INDEX_NAME_1): limit=100                                                                                                                         |
|               |       SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |         BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |           DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[1]                                                                                                                            |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                        |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
